{"ratings":[{"id":"C1","consequence":"nuisance","trigger":"normal","reason":"A redundant stored row cannot be removed through the catalog command, so its startup warning continues to appear."},{"id":"C2","consequence":"outage","trigger":"unusual","reason":"A future built-in colliding with an existing runtime model could prevent startup, but no new collision beyond the addressed model exists in this change."},{"id":"C3","consequence":"test","trigger":"plausible","reason":"A future owner decision may require updating the hard-coded test expectations, with no demonstrated runtime effect."},{"id":"C4","consequence":"test","trigger":"plausible","reason":"The snapshot filters the new model out across roles, leaving widened-route changes involving it unchecked by that test."},{"id":"C5","consequence":"outage","trigger":"plausible","reason":"A saved routing choice using an effort supported by the runtime model but not the built-in causes the upgraded daemon to fail at startup."},{"id":"C6","consequence":"diag","trigger":"normal","reason":"The displayed pin reason omits earlier rationale, which remains available in the referenced evidence document."}]}